# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# This project is developed on Windows, where several tools write CRLF, but Go
# source, shell scripts and YAML workflows all have to be LF: `gofmt -l` fails
# on a CRLF .go file, and a CRLF shell script fails on a Linux CI runner with
# an unhelpful "bad interpreter" error. Declaring it here fixes it once for
# everyone instead of per-file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
